1320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The mere availability of AI tools does not in itself lead to improved student engagement. Their impact depends on how thoughtfully they are designed, implemented, and embedded into teaching and learning processes. Meaningful outcomes are achieved not through access alone, but through intentional integration.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1322 0 obj
<<
